[186.881576, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.881642, "o", "INTRODUCTION"]
[186.881705, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.881784, "o", "You have been playing a game in which the rules are as follows:"]
[186.881847, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.881909, "o", "•"]
[186.881969, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.882029, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.882092, "o", "•"]
[186.882151, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.882213, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.882276, "o", "Each game consists of 2 turns."]
[186.882337, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.882399, "o", "o For each turn, roll one six-sided die 6 times, making a note of each number in the order it"]
[186.882459, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.882524, "o", "was rolled."]
[186.882585, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.88265, "o", "o Once you have your list of six numbers, determine the possible scores for the turn"]
[186.882716, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.882779, "o", "according to the categories below."]
[186.882838, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.882899, "o", "For each game, score the game by finding the highest possible combined score from the two"]
[186.882958, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.883019, "o", "turns, noting that no category may be used more than once (i.e. you may not score the two hands"]
[186.883096, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.883159, "o", "in the same category)."]
[186.883219, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.883287, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.883349, "o", "As you have a keen interest in statistics, you have decided to simulate several games in Excel and"]
[186.883415, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.883479, "o", "analyze the resulting scores. Questions 20 to 26 require only the ‘turn’ results. Questions 27 to 29"]
[186.883539, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.883602, "o", "require analysis of the ‘game’ results."]
[186.883663, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.88373, "o", "The workbook provided contains dice rolls from 6,000 simulated turns (3,000 games). Use the rules"]
[186.883796, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.883863, "o", "below to first determine the possible scores for the turns, and then to find the highest possible score for"]
[186.883924, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.883987, "o", "each game."]
[186.884048, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.884112, "o", "SCORING TURNS"]
[186.884171, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.884238, "o", "Category"]
[186.884301, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.884369, "o", "\r\n"]
