[186.884558, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.884621, "o", "Score"]
[186.884681, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.884748, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.88481, "o", "Any turn"]
[186.88487, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.884937, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.885002, "o", "The highest number rolled in the turn"]
[186.885066, "o", "\r\n"]
[186.895082, "o", "multiplied by"]
[186.895308, "o", "\r\nthe number of times it was rolled that turn\r\n\r\nAny turn\r\n\r\nSum of all six dice rolls\r\n\r\nAny turn\r\n\r\nThe highest number rolled\r\nmultiplied by\r\nthe lowest number rolled\r\nmultiplied by\r\nthe difference between them\r\n\r\nHigh and Often\r\nSummation\r\n\r\nHighs and Lows\r\n\r\nOnly two numbers\r\n\r\nThe six rolls are all one of two numbers\r\n(e.g. 3-6-3-6-6-6)\r\n\r\n30\r\n\r\nAll the numbers\r\n\r\nThe rolls are (in any order) 1-2-3-4-5-6\r\n\r\n40\r\n\r\nWhen listed in the order rolled the\r\nOrdered subset of numbers contain a run of 4 consecutive\r\nfour\r\nincreasing or decreasing numbers (e.g.\r\n1-2-3-4 or 5-4-3-2)\r\n\r\n50\r\n\r\nFor Questions 20 to 27, select your answer from a multiple choice list.\r\nFor Questions 28 to 29, you are required to type in your answer.\r\nPrepare your model and then use it to answer the given questions.\r\nWhen finished, please upload your workbook (Question 30).\r\n\r\n\f"]
